5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I need to know how much time we lose during the switch.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The budget line hasn't changed. I need to see the actual floor costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should decide who gets the worse seats before we start moving.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort is invisible on paper. I need to check the physical setup.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Who sits next to whom changes how we talk. I want to see the plan.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, if the cost is high, maybe we shouldn't move at all.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, knowing the cost helps us decide if moving is even possible.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, comfort is important, but fairness matters more to me right now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, fairness is subjective. My back is not.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Mizuki, I agree. We need to be transparent about the trade-offs.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the morning routine and the past shuffles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will check the billing basis and the facilities quote.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look at the drawn plan and the staff survey.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the sound readings and the physio note.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will look at the arrival times and what the new joiners said.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
